Body:
@marcusquinn thanks again for calling out the downstream use case here. This PR is now merge-ready and all checks are green.

For a bit more issue-side signal: this also seems aligned with #5971, and more broadly with the UI/plugin requests in #16874 and #15007. This is not the full custom panel API described there, but it does provide a smaller sidebar extension point that looks immediately useful.

@adamdotdevin since there is both downstream demand and related issue-side interest, I’d really appreciate an Opencode team review / approval when you have a moment. Happy to make any follow-up changes if needed.
